{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0390_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "6cb92069969931933719c72052ef53cfd58d39b96b5521dd9e025de18204717a", "ja": "夏のお仕事を乗り越えるためにも、\n先輩とプールでリフレッシュ！　うん、いいかも♪", "zh": "为了能顺利熬过夏天的工作，\n和前辈去泳池好好放松一下！嗯，感觉挺不错呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0390_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_intro_1001_p", "source_sha256": "0371ad63d8281ef9b11b808081a61fc068a15f948a56f4775dcfe133ca44636f", "ja": "青羽さん、音無さんとプールに行くんですか？", "zh": "青羽小姐要和音无小姐一起去泳池吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0390_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "482a249051472ae956945b16226446b1b943558297c6cca2d57e736af992174c", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！　そうなんです。\nこれから誘ってみるんですけど、行きたいなぁって♪", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！是啊。\n我正准备邀请她，不过真的好想去啊♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0390_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_intro_1003_p", "source_sha256": "d8f1b72a938d73ec6005565d8711c111e59e5165e09978031a98dfecd55687d0", "ja": "いいですね！　きっと音無さんも喜びますよ。\nこのところ、毎日本当に暑いですから。", "zh": "好主意！音无小姐肯定也会很高兴的。\n毕竟最近每天都实在太热了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0390_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_intro_1004_p", "source_sha256": "52710b899c21019318226ed0b548aa741f31a196cbc5495de52fc1e5fed54b6e", "ja": "『BATTLE OF THEATER』の影響もあって、\nアイドルたちの熱気もすごいですし。", "zh": "也有『BATTLE OF THEATER』的影响，\n偶像们的热情也非同寻常呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0390_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "adfd25ce0d6ecfdfc80861a2c58bd732c4f19c3fc1beb1521ef627ab10252433", "ja": "みんな燃えてますもんね！　\nそっか、だから今年はいつもより暑く感じるのかな？", "zh": "大家都干劲十足呢！\n这样啊，难怪今年感觉比平时更热吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0390_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_intro_1006_102mis", "source_sha256": "bf4b331623d18f4574142364923d61470851e3ec61323ff3b15689b8135e1e55", "ja": "はっ、『BATTLE OF THEATER』といえば！\n社長さんがお話があるっていってましたよ！", "zh": "啊，说到《BATTLE OF THEATER》！社长说有话要跟我们讲！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0390_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_intro_1007_102mis", "source_sha256": "88a7a25dd1e6070e39874dd13d859223ba32cd9082193073f3a5f019fa90c3fb", "ja": "何でも、\nこの暑～い夏にピッタリの企画を用意したんだとか！", "zh": "听说还准备了特别适合这个炎热夏天的企划！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0390_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_intro_1008_p", "source_sha256": "e9541728ebf6af72b27394261d66642ebfdfe46ddd03c8681be08b13f929847b", "ja": "おっ、本当ですか？　ありがとうございます。\nさっそく事務所に行ってきますね！", "zh": "哦，真的吗？谢谢您。\n我这就去事务所！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0390_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_intro_1009_102mis", "source_sha256": "b573792642e461fb838c43ae6713591067eeeef555d9493e06cf68f2ce2d06a2", "ja": "はーい！　ふふっ、私も暑～い夏に\nピッタリのプール、探しておこうっと♪", "zh": "好——！呵呵，我也会找一个非常适合炎热夏天的泳池♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0390_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_intro_1010_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0390_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_intro_1011_president", "source_sha256": "4f8334f50a6737aedf097c02c31c23c953a6bd0806af37cd647cb8bc2e8e616b", "ja": "おお～君、来てくれたか！\n忙しいところすまないね！", "zh": "哦～你来了啊！\n百忙之中真是不好意思！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0390_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_intro_1012_p", "source_sha256": "ce39bb6abf46dde203d099aa9ceb1b6d78a7e966e6983f2fbe928d74692319a9", "ja": "いえいえ！\n仕事で忙しいのは嬉しい限りですよ。", "zh": "哪里哪里！\n工作能忙得起来，我高兴还来不及呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0390_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_intro_1013_101kot", "source_sha256": "e0769a2388f13df95fa8f36b9a347692e6dae020564f674477dd6fd4ad825c6b", "ja": "でもあんまり根を詰め過ぎないでくださいね？\n{$P$}さんが倒れたら大変ですから。", "zh": "不过，也请不要太拼命了哦？要是{$P$}先生倒下了，可就麻烦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0390_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_intro_1014_p", "source_sha256": "41103db9c0a8ac0643ad26e9e772d1ca595866628a68c2ff5e3b02be4cc63cce", "ja": "はは、気を付けます。……それで社長、お話とは。\n何でも夏にピッタリの企画を用意したとか。", "zh": "哈哈，我会注意的。……那么，社长，您说有事找我，是指什么呢？\n听说您准备了一个非常适合夏天的企划。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0390_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_intro_1015_president", "source_sha256": "5b07f257392c7fcfd7d7508b19e29b5c5bba1065372358d8d646f4cef207d125", "ja": "はっはっは。言ったそばから仕事熱心だねぇ、君は！\nうむ、次の『BATTLE OF THEATER』なんだが……", "zh": "哈哈哈，我才刚说完，你就这么热衷于工作啊，真是的！\n嗯，关于下一次的『BATTLE OF THEATER』……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0390_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_intro_1016_president", "source_sha256": "16ddd52b7c9c0d1108a9c55e43434628ac06dc87a2bf61ecd313a87ec961fdf0", "ja": "ズバリ！　『アイドル水着大運動会』でいこうと思う！", "zh": "我想就定为《偶像泳装大运动会》！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0390_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_intro_1017_101kot", "source_sha256": "75c072baf2ab27685a8755736c2cb4eaa2ab2061e2357ff42eecca050e73ee95", "ja": "わぁ！　夏のアイドルの鉄板というか、剛速球ですね♪", "zh": "哇！该说是夏日偶像的王道呢，还是正中红心的超级直球呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0390_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_intro_1018_president", "source_sha256": "505da26fa207c0d244a12b1502fe8fee9a4b39a460fd40220ad00832066b8f1b", "ja": "ちょうどウォーターパークを丸ごと借りられてね。\nあの会場なら、52人全員が入っても問題ないだろう。", "zh": "正好把整个水上乐园都租下来了呢。\n那个场地的话，就算52人全部进去也没问题吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0390_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_intro_1019_p", "source_sha256": "ac7b4a79ec92bee17dcc8f2a53a5f77d724df82943e8d0a8551abd599c4a7f90", "ja": "そんなところを借りられたんですか！？\nすごいですね。一体どうやって……？", "zh": "居然能租到那种地方吗！？\n真厉害。到底是怎么做到的……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0390_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_intro_1020_president", "source_sha256": "c1ba0d21094b136ecd7e322fd9b08df066229d37cb69866749defdd6fb19e76b", "ja": "ふっふっふ、そこは君、ちょっとしたツテだよ。\nま、細かいことは気にしないでくれたまえ！", "zh": "呵呵呵，这可是我稍微托了点关系。\n嘛，细节就别在意啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0390_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_intro_1021_p", "source_sha256": "b9d60ccb6ffdbacf623fce68bc1a1adac06be32ba76c49361d70f8cdd9ced5f8", "ja": "わかりました……。とにかく、全員で運動会というのは\n盛り上がりますね。チームの勝敗もつけやすいですし。", "zh": "我知道了……总之，所有人一起开运动会，\n确实会很热闹呢。队伍之间也容易分出胜负。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0390_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_intro_1022_president", "source_sha256": "70f94539c89b2ee981f5ce109aac28b44319ea13d3f5a5a923fff4c41f5359bd", "ja": "いや、それなんだが、今回は投票や勝ち負けのない、\nエキシビションマッチにするつもりだ。", "zh": "不，不过这次打算举办一场没有投票、也不分胜负的表演赛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0390_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_intro_1023_p", "source_sha256": "d02917e96ffa958906510c02bc9a9ed39cdfdc5268ccdf52908409b15b789160", "ja": "エキシビションマッチ、ですか？", "zh": "表演赛吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0390_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_intro_1024_president", "source_sha256": "311e8df46a0167351b8d3b5861e6ae4d36dd89e150867658cf7a5332364d5024", "ja": "『BATTLE OF THEATER』は長期戦だろう？\nアイドルにもファンにも、息抜きが必要だと思ってね。", "zh": "『BATTLE OF THEATER』是一场持久战吧？\n我觉得偶像和粉丝们都需要稍微歇口气呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0390_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_intro_1025_p", "source_sha256": "503ac2da269d55463a7523d27ed32d9594fe4729926b494c3a4df5028bb9982e", "ja": "確かに、真剣なバトルは見る側もやる側も\nなかなか消耗しますからね。", "zh": "确实，认真的对决不管是看的人还是参与的人，都相当耗神呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0390_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_intro_1026_president", "source_sha256": "baf74d242ba9e666fa49e7f8c9506505a8c8b29701a8a99a4529777bd7a3fe0c", "ja": "うむ。たまには勝敗を忘れ、皆で全力で楽しむ！\nそんな時間を君にはプロデュースしてもらいたい。", "zh": "嗯。偶尔忘却胜负，大家一起尽情享受！\n希望你能制作出这样一段时光。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0390_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_intro_1027_p", "source_sha256": "c4b8cb1071dcc0d18ed538309880cc7cd53ffbaf8902adf10d6ed18a409ecd64", "ja": "それで巨大プールですか。\n確かに、リフレッシュするにはこれ以上ない場所かと！", "zh": "所以就选了巨型泳池吗？\n确实，要放松的话，没有比这里更合适的地方了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0390_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_intro_1028_101kot", "source_sha256": "0c131db7c441ed74e385cd7cfbf1b74183c693e086a843d0369fea78c2d4a040", "ja": "いいですね～、プール♪　私もたまには、\nオシャレなプールでリフレッシュ、なんて……♪", "zh": "不错呢～泳池♪ 我偶尔也想去时髦的泳池放松一下……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0390_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_intro_1029_p", "source_sha256": "5f085e1a8b4b0c99dc799a950301d6be522791f32e8ae25a6f1698d400282777", "ja": "あ、そういえばさっき青羽さんが、\n音無さんをプールに誘いたいって話してましたよ。", "zh": "啊，对了，刚才青羽小姐还说想邀请音无小姐去游泳池呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0390_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_intro_1030_101kot", "source_sha256": "db1a7c8c083c6c7ad11327ce6785dc000d7e535156ccfa0d5e3d25ad226f78f4", "ja": "美咲ちゃんが私を！？　ど、どうしましょう。\n見せられるような水着、あったかしら……。", "zh": "美咲要邀请我去！？怎、怎么办才好。有没有适合穿出去见人的泳衣呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0390_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_intro_1031_president", "source_sha256": "dc05e45985ed8fc24a7b94aca57cdd57d334f69da8c11db92d636d9852490213", "ja": "うぉっほん！　それじゃあ君、あとは頼んだよ！\nフレッシュな大運動会、期待しているぞ！", "zh": "咳咳！那么，接下来就拜托你了！\n我很期待这场活力十足的盛大运动会！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0390_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_intro_1032_p", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0390_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_intro_1033_p", "source_sha256": "fe8dce97413be17bd7ababc87c2d9057d5be2310e6dcc4091779652e8f7b95f6", "ja": "（巨大プールで大運動会か……みんな喜びそうだな！\nさっそく企画を進めるとしよう！）", "zh": "（在巨型泳池里举办大型运动会吗……大家应该都会很开心吧！那就赶紧开始推进企划吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
